Package: com.iosvcam.opencam
Name: iOS-VCAM OpenCam
Version: 0.3.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Open-source, editable virtual camera tweak. Runs in mediaserverd so it covers every capture client (stock Camera, TikTok, all apps). Pulls an RTMP stream on-device, decodes H264 via VideoToolbox, and substitutes a fresh camera-format sample buffer downstream (VTPixelTransferSession scale/convert + VTPixelRotationSession rotate/front-mirror) without ever mutating the camera buffer, like the closed vcamera. Fail-open everywhere (any error falls back to the real camera). NOTE: the global microphone/audio hook (VCamAudioMS.x) is temporarily out of this build while the video path is verified; it returns in a later version.
Maintainer: iOS-VCAM
Author: iOS-VCAM
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Conflicts: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.system-hook, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-probe, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.daemon, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
Replaces: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
